<title>INDIA: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT GHANA IN NEHRU GOLD CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT GHANA IN NEHRU GOLD CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Nehru Gold</p>
<p>Cup soccer tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Uzbekistan 3 Ghana 2 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Vyacheslav Ponamarev 40, Ravashanjon Mataliev</p>
<p>75, Anvarjon Soliev 85</p>
<p>Ghana - Sekyi Yaw 34, 56</p>
</text>
